              "pages": {
                "end": 4,
                "start": 4
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Toby J. Heytens, the Court should reject any notion that a Fifth Amendment violation can occur before trial in the specific type of Fifth Amendment violation alleged here, which is the use of statements in violation of Garrity."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Petitioner",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "228d5ced477283fd6b05c50d0296cc06011f908512b3409137c6c01eb9f1cc11",
